    <string name="settings_about_not_official_body">Lagrange Reader is an independent community project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the BookOrbit maintainers. BookOrbit remains the source of the server and library experience used by this app.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_acknowledgements">Acknowledgements</string>
    <string name="settings_about_acknowledgements_body">Thanks to the BookOrbit maintainers and contributors, the Readium Foundation, the Android and Kotlin open-source communities, and everyone who tests Lagrange Reader and reports issues.</string>
